  "description": "A queen with an entire class in the palm of her hand, striking fear into the hearts of her subjects with a single glance. 'This is wrong,' they think to themselves - 'This is not fair. We are all equal.' - so why is it that not one of them speaks up? If silence is our answer to tyranny, then who will help the helpless?\n\n(Source: Spottoon)",
